<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-INDENT: 36pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>根据学生先进表彰制度的办法，本学期学生先进评比工作请按如下</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>办法进行（请注意各步骤的时间）。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2017</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学年第二学期学生先进评比办法</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt 0pt 0pt 48pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=黑体>一、</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=黑体>各项先进名额分配</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">1、三好学生、优秀学生干部等以上先进名额总量，平行班控制在总人数的18%以内，创新班控制在25%以内。校级优秀学生标兵各班1名。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2、“文明中学生标兵”推选人数：平行班控制在总人数的15%以内，创新班控制在18%以内。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">3、学习积极分子：每班推荐2名。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">4、工作之星：各班可推荐工作之星2名。德育处、团委可根据学生干部或者学生自主管理的工作实绩，向学校推荐工作之星与优秀学生干部,推荐人员不占班级名额。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><FONT face=黑体>二、申请条件</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（一）</FONT>“三好学生”</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">1、品德表现：爱国、爱党、遵守法规、遵守社会公德、诚信、友善、感恩，在校内外的日常行为规范起示范作用，服务集体（工作积极，出色，有贡献），热爱劳动，尊敬师长、爱护公物、生活节俭；有良好的独立生活方式、交往方式和文明修养，获学校、家庭、社区的好评。上学期及本学期两次</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>综合素质考评必须</FONT>A等</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（综合素质评价中没有违反校纪不良行为记录）。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2、学业水平：学习自主，有良好的自学习惯；虚心好学，各门学习成绩均为优良。依据期中、期末、学考等成绩，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>综合名次在年级前</FONT>25％或总成绩班级前40%</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">3、运动健康：参加体育课、课间操、课外活动、军训、远足等锻炼，刻苦认真，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学年体育达标与抽测成绩必须达到优良</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，具有良好的体育精神和心理品质（体育任课教师参与评价），</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>本学期运动健康综合素质考评达到</FONT>B等及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">4、艺术素养：按要求完成音乐、美术、劳技等学科的学习，成绩合格。有一定的审美情趣，无审美情趣方面的不良行为，能积极参与班级黑板报设计、班级读书角设计、学校校园文化设计等各类设计活动，积极参与班级教室美化或寝室美化工作，</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>本学期艺术素养综合素质考评达到</FONT>B等及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">5、创新实践：在学校、班级组织开展的各种教育活动中表现突出；主动积极投身社会实践活动，在志愿者服务等公益活动中起示范带头作用。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>本学期创新实践综合素质考评达到</FONT>B等及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">6、在全面发展的基础上，某方面有突出贡献、突出成绩、突出表现。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（二）优秀学生干部</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">1、在品德表现、运动健康、艺术素养、创新实践已经达到上述三好生要求的情况下，学业成绩可以略放宽。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt">2、管理与服务工作出色，能力具备以下条件之一： ①负责班级管理，岗位责任心强，能力、实绩突出，班内民主评价好，有较高威信。②参与学校学生会、团委、社团、宿舍楼层、学生安全、文明与秩序等管理，岗位责任心强，能力、实绩突出，得到主管部门推荐。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（三）优秀学生标兵</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在品德表现、学业水平、运动健康、艺术素养、创新实践已经达到上述三好生要求的情况下，同时在某方面有突出贡献、突出成绩、突出表现。在班级内起到标杆引领作用的学生，是全班同学学习和公认的榜样。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（四）文明学生标兵</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>在本学期综合素质评价</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>品德表现、运动健康、创新实践必须达到</FONT>B等及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，特别是品德表现必须诚信、友善、感恩，在校内外的日常行为规范起示范作用，服务集体（工作积极，出色，有贡献），热爱劳动，尊敬师长、爱护公物、生活节俭；有良好的独立生活方式、交往方式和文明修养，在文明创建、爱心捐助、两操锻炼、劳动卫生、公益活动和其它日常行为表现等方面在班级表现比较突出（综合素质评价中没有违反校纪不良行为记录）。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（五）学习积极分子</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>学习勤奋刻苦，各学科成绩良好，没有明显偏科现象，在综合素质评价</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>品德表现必须达到</FONT>B等及以上</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，班中学习成绩进步最快的同学。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom: 0.5000gd"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（六）工作之星</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 6pt 0pt 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-para-margin-top: 0.5000gd"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>虽然不够优秀学生干部的条件，但在班级安全（含交通）、卫生、体锻、纪律、宿舍管理等方面，工作有出色成绩的。或团委、学生会、主任助理、社团、宿舍楼层、学生安全、文明与秩序等管理，责任心强，实绩突出，受到老师、同学或主管部门好评。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 12.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 12.05pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 1.0000"><B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>附：</FONT></SPAN></B><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>有以下十四种行为之一的学生，不宜推荐为以上各项先进：</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="WORD-BREAK: break-all; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>（</FONT>1）有故意损坏公物行为；（2）有早恋行为；（3）考试作弊；（4）沉迷于电子游戏；（5）处理同学之间的矛盾，有过激不当行为；（6）本学期受过学校处分；（7）未经德育处审批同意，私自带手机、MP3、MP4进校，（MP3、MP4用于英语听力训练，或校外活动时使用，不作违纪论处）；（8）一学期累计三次违反住校生纪律；（9）早读早学迟到，一学期超过5次；（10）未按规定穿着校服超过3次；（11）一学期迟到次数累计超过5次；（12）家长接送时，出现违规停放、掉头等影响安全秩序等不良行为，一学期累计超过3次；（13）仪容仪表不符合《中学生日常行为规范》；（14）文明习惯、素养有明显欠缺（如尊敬师长、爱护公物等）。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-WEIGHT: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 0.0000pt"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
